From: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:21:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] iw: update nl80211.h

The kernel of the image sends per-link station statistics only on
request, with the flag NL80211_ATTR_STA_DUMP_LINK_STATS. The header
of iw predates that flag.

The header is a copy of the nl80211.h of the mac80211 backport that
the image builds, not of a kernel release, because only that copy
gives each attribute the number of the running kernel. It also holds
two local values of enum nl80211_radar_event, which iw does not use.

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
 nl80211.h |  973 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 947 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

